WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.309 line:88% align:center
Start the gateway on your computer, then open it on your phone.

2
00:00:06.309 --> 00:00:10.245 line:88% align:center
Manage accounts and APIs on desktop. The active connection stays
first.

3
00:00:10.245 --> 00:00:14.347 line:88% align:center
See official quota and reset credits beside each account. Add
accounts only on desktop.

4
00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:20.234 line:88% align:center
Add a custom API and query its upstream model list.

5
00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:26.823 line:88% align:center
Browse local and SSH chats, then continue the same conversation.

6
00:00:26.823 --> 00:00:34.152 line:88% align:center
The active connection stays on top, with quota and reset cards
beside each account.

7
00:00:34.152 --> 00:00:40.318 line:88% align:center
API connections load upstream models. Apply your selection to the
current chat.

8
00:00:40.318 --> 00:00:46.453 line:88% align:center
Computer-use requests reach your phone, with conversation,
persistent or deny options as supported.

9
00:00:46.453 --> 00:00:51.574 line:88% align:center
Read and respond to implementation plans from your phone.
